# Branch types for this project — edit to suit your team.
# Format: type|description
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
# Both make branch (interactive menu) and the post-checkout hook
# read this file, so adding a type here enables it everywhere.
#
# See https://conventionalbranch.org for the full spec.
# Trunk branches (main, master, develop) are always allowed implicitly.
feat|new feature
fix|bug fix
chore|maintenance (deps, docs, config)
hotfix|urgent production fix
ai|AI-assisted change
